  <h2 id="cert-heading">A study tool, built to travel.</h2>
  <p class="tech-lead">I built ICY CERT ENGINE as a standalone Security+ SY0-701 study interface: 519 original question-and-answer records with explanations, search, objective filters, bookmarks and review self-ratings.</p>
  <p>The interface and bank fit in one HTML file. A saved copy works offline, and progress stays in the browser with explicit backup controls. The engineering case covers that portability and its limits—not a claim that every answer has been independently fact-checked or that this is an official CompTIA product.</p>
